<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Company Onboarding Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Hello {{companyName}},</h2>
  <p>Thank you for registering your company profile with us.</p>
  <p>Here is a summary of your submission:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Website:</strong> {{companyWebsite}}</li>
    <li><strong>Industry:</strong> {{industryType}}</li>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{corporateEmail}}</li>
    <li><strong>Phone:</strong> {{phoneNumber}}</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We’ll review your profile and get back to you shortly.</p>
  <br/>
  <p>Best regards,<br/>Support Team</p>
</body>
</html>
